              "type": "text",
              "content": "12. "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Individual project (long term):",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " This requires collecting data over 2 weeks or more."
