          "bbox": [
            0.187,
            0.368,
            0.831,
            0.407
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "In and Out: Track how many times you step out of your house in a day. Do this for a month."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.228,
            0.411,
            0.846,
            0.451
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(i) Describe the variability and central tendency of this data. Make a dot plot."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.228,
            0.455,
            0.846,
            0.495
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(ii) Do you find anything interesting about this data? Share your observations."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
