            0.865
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(b) Estimating time: Check the time and close your eyes. Open them when you think 1 minute has passed (no counting). Note down after how m-any seconds you opened your eyes. Collect this data for yourself and for your family members. Repeat this activity to estimate 3 minutes."
